7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to know why the car is often unavailable or messy when I need it. I'll look into the state of the car at handover and trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"We're guessing too much. To get a real picture of who is actually driving and what it costs, I'll check the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
