12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. The current lack of structure is inefficient. Let's move forward and see what the data actually shows us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'm satisfied. Let's just make sure we're all being honest about what we find. I'm interested to see if the diary matches the actual costs Minako is looking into.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope this helps us stop arguing. I'll do my best to be thorough with the things I'm checking. Let's just... see what happens.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
